      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open the MDM page",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open <strong>☰</strong>, then <strong>User Management</strong>, then <strong>MDM</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8096e7b2a2de9748.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Copy the SCEP details",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Copy the <strong>SCEP URL</strong> and the <strong>Challenge</strong>. Your MDM needs both.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7bf334ff5e37e648.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Connect Fleet",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On a computer, run <code>rmscep mdm-apply</code> with the challenge and your Fleet token. Fleet now knows this deployment. With another MDM, add a SCEP authority by hand.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/15a658b711bf2529.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1180
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The same command sets up your team: the certificate, the apps and a <strong>Deploy App</strong> icon. Run it before any phone enrols: apps install only then.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7a169b964c0c5298.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1014
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
